  "title": "Lovely Caramelized Middle Eastern Red Peppers Muhammara",
  "description": "This savory Middle Eastern dip is made with caramelized red peppers and features star anise, making it a unique and delicious snack. It is also ayurvedic-rajasic-friendly.",
