  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Place the red peppers on a baking sheet and roast for 30 minutes.",
    "Remove the peppers from the oven and let them cool.",
    "Peel the peppers and place them in a blender or food processor.",
    "Add the star anise, garlic, walnuts, olive oil, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper to the blender.",
    "Blend the mixture until it is smooth and creamy.",
    "Taste the muhammara and add the pomegranate molasses if desired.",
    "Serve the muhammara with pita bread or vegetables."
